# research-system — the root repository (github.com/huiweicorporation-gif/research-system, private).
#
# Owner decision 2026-11-19: each module keeps its own repository and is pushed separately. This repository
# holds the papers that govern the whole system and the records only it has: the roadmap and the constitution,
# the morning briefings, the order ledger, the opportunity dossiers and our channels' readings.

# ── Modules with their own repository ───────────────────────────────────────
# Pushed on their own to the same account. Tracking them here as well would give every file two histories.
/radar/
/radar-dev/
/commander/
/studio/
/analysis/
/feedback/
/tools/SkillSpector/

# ── Reference material, not part of the running system ──────────────────────
# Owner 2026-11-19: shopapivn's tool is for reading, not depending on. `Documents/` is reference the owner will
# delete one day, so nothing here may rely on it. OpenMontage is a separate AGPL-3.0 project, kept vendored and
# never edited (see analysis/README.md, "AGPL boundary").
/Documents/
/youtube-main/
/OpenMontage-main/

# ── What the system produces, and what weighs ──────────────────────────────
# studio-projects/ alone is 3.7 GB of video, pictures and narration; voice-eval/ is 15 GB of voice models and
# samples. Both are output or working material, rebuildable, and belong nowhere near a code repository.
/studio-projects/
/voice-eval/

# ── Pictures, sound and video ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Owner 2026-11-19: leave media out to keep the repository light. What this drops today: the channel art of
# ho-so/kenh-the-first-humans/ (cover, avatar, logo) and the two German and Korean voice tests of
# ho-so/2026-11-10-dog-market/. Keep a copy of those outside git.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.webp
*.bmp
*.ico
*.wav
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm

# ── The data pillar's database ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# tru/tru.db is rewritten whole every load (hourly), so git would keep a fresh 4 MB copy of it each time. It
# does hold records written by hand that live nowhere else, the debt ledger and the lesson store among them:
# those want a text export of their own, not a binary in every commit.
/tru/*.db
/tru/*.db-wal
/tru/*.db-shm

# ── Environments, caches and editor state ──────────────────────────────────
# `.venv*/`, not `.venv/`: tools/.venv-skillspector sits beside SkillSpector rather than inside it, so the
# exact-name pattern missed it and `git add -A` began staging the whole Anthropic SDK out of its site-packages.
.venv*/
venv*/
hf-cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
.vscode/
.env
*.secret.*
*secret*.json
*.key
*.pem
